# @sentriy/backend

Single shared Postgres-backed API for the MarvelSyllabus movie-ticketing platform.

This file is intentionally empty — `src/worker.ts` will be created by moving the canonical worker
out of `prototype/functions/api/[[path]].ts` once ticket 01 (runnable platform foundation) lands on
`integration/movie-ticketing-platform`.

Do not edit `prototype/functions/api/[[path]].ts` directly after this point; all API changes go
through `backend/src/worker.ts`, and both Pages projects re-export it.
